    <section id="evidence-base" class="bg-slate-900 text-white">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="mb-10 max-w-[640px]">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">Sources and evidence</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-300">
            This page draws on peer-reviewed research, UNHCR operational data, and reporting from the humanitarian sector. We distinguish between evidence that makes clinical claims and contextual sources that provide background.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-6 xl:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Core evidence</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">Peer-reviewed and official data behind the numbers on this page.</p>
            <div class="mt-5 space-y-3">
              <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/36037741/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/50 p-4 transition hover:border-white/20 hover:bg-slate-900/70 [&_strong]:block [&_strong]:text-[13px] [&_strong]:text-white [&_strong]:[overflow-wrap:anywhere] [&_span]:mt-1 [&_span]:block [&_span]:text-xs [&_span]:leading-normal [&_span]:text-slate-400 [&_span]:[overflow-wrap:anywhere]">
                <strong>PubMed: Refugees' mental health — Dzaleka</strong>
